cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "RAWATTA: Regime-Aware Attention Approximation for VGGT-Omega, in Rust + CUDA"
abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Training-Free Acceleration of Multi-View 3D Transformers via Regime-Aware
  Attention Approximation". A native Rust + CUDA inference engine for the multi-view 3D transformer
  VGGT-Omega with the training-free settings RAWATTA and RAWATTA-Fast and the exact engine, plus
  weight conversion, evaluation and calibration tools. The code is under Apache-2.0, except
  crates/vggt-omega, which is under the FAIR Noncommercial Research License like the VGGT-Omega
  weights (research use only).
